623335", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035460_8514674871956668_5536053659043017688_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=2Ly0N3ACs5gQ7kNvwFXch8Z&_nc_oc=AdoBJNcj0q-_cp3_EWvUZoE_8vZRBMv6Y5JmwPDer1ZUYyzMcaKUJCUSkos4wo5NAqg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN1bFf58rGjuKFGdHrUdWcVgSarLyZJ-Nsh90mqUTO5Qw&oe=6ADCB1E2"}, "display_name": "RCP VR", "keywords": ["CPR", "Training", "FirstAid", "Life", "Medical"], "long_description": "Have you ever wondered how you would react in a medical emergency?\n\nImagine this: you're at work, in a shopping mall, or walking down the street, and suddenly, someone collapses next to you. Would you know what to do?\n\nAt Four Players VR, we\u2019ve developed a Virtual Reality Cardiopulmonary Resuscitation (CPR) simulation that trains you to act with confidence and effectiveness in critical situations.\n\nGet ready to save lives:\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator).\n\nDon\u2019t let fear paralyze you. Join us and gain the skills you need to make a difference in critical moments with Four Players VR!", "short_description": "\u2764\ufe0f Identify: Recognize a cardiac emergency and immediately activate the response protocol.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Execute: Learn how to properly perform CPR maneuvers, from compressions to ventilation, ensuring the best possible assistance.\n\n\u2764\ufe0f Use: Become an expert in the safe and effective use of an AED (automated external defibrillator)."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Hero Cover 3000x900-01.png", "id": "1521375421828587", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982664_1521375425161920_9188152085567170692_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_23An9drqGIQ7kNvwGOZGDj&_nc_oc=AdoQLvgyeGYFdOO1y723HeHBHb0v5t7lvCVDhZ1uiwP6dB0yKd0stoYXospXeAlFH48&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOr1IvmNflMbfKLSnLQwpQP4o1LO5PXCRM92-alupPUeg&oe=6ADCBF73"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Square 1440x1440-01.png", "id": "1067684668157887", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75221326_1067684671491220_581184548072541025_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UimoVSG6k8YQ7kNvwEukR8H&_nc_oc=AdrcAKRnpMqcCGhsW37eGyiG9Kk_ucDyFXYpYW6jjxc4S29fnDQpeq2cswBdFtnY8bQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNxbtY3nzu_ufvJi9sa89PDJNg15v91fbGtAAeiIJtfIw&oe=6ADCB3EB"}, {"file_name": "Logo 9000x1440-01.png", "id": "875705051208789", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75339313_875705054542122_3606485636804263314_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=KPmpGlTyzhAQ7kNvwFkNPjB&_nc_oc=Ado1lbGZ4jDmasZTObqJrKZhT0K0inKiHYTgQ14Ihw6qB_0-pU7TTWqKXPtRBWEW1xg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPHliwXAoGNgvRexHTCYkoyV0ioFl6b1D-MJXo7wEKI0w&oe=6ADCD122"}, {"file_name": "Icon 512x512-01.png", "id": "581195491100081", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57568678_581195494433414_3254618470938933182_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mHXp9Qec954Q7kNvwEO96ar&_nc_oc=Ado2I22oYPIsJL2a7QwHsIbWcn-WF-z1Ra2DKE-iImvKjjKynkwrLImgr3yn_3mJJf0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNaO6FH6txH3ejaagAgenvyIjXxXNq_5zcVQ8MDAedDaQ&oe=6ADCD3BD"}, {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape 1008x1440-01.png", "id": "480126738396124", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982658_480126745062790_195688056568553292